#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:9
#: c277482ccf934a15beb5fbebaa3c5d56
msgid "Rotational Trading"
msgstr "轮动交易"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 50024937c38f49c7b1d8f6b779065237 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"Rotational trading involves buying top-performing assets and selling "
"underperforming ones. **PyBroker** can be used for backtesting these "
"strategies."
msgstr "轮动交易涉及购买表现最好的资产，同时出售表现不佳的资产。**PyBroker** 可用于回测此类策略。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 20fe7e0970ed4ffe9c19988357ebdcc9 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:33
msgid ""
"Our strategy will involve ranking and buying stocks with the highest "
"`price rate-of-change (ROC) "
"<https://www.investopedia.com/terms/p/pricerateofchange.asp>`__. To "
"start, we'll define a 20-day ROC indicator using `TA-Lib "
"<https://github.com/TA-Lib/ta-lib-python>`__:"
msgstr ""
"我们的策略将涉及对 `价格涨幅（ROC） "
"<https://www.investopedia.com/terms/p/pricerateofchange.asp>`__ "
"最高的股票进行排名和购买。首先，我们将使用 `TA-Lib <https://github.com/TA-Lib/ta-lib-"
"python>`__ 定义一个 20 天的 ROC 指标："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 1c8d38c6109e473ba964ee80dd412e3f Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:58
msgid "Next, let's define the rules of our strategy:"
msgstr "接下来，让我们定义策略的规则："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:60
#: e6646bbe8fdd44bf94d8a4d38d8a3102
msgid "Buy the two stocks with the highest 20-day ROC."
msgstr "购买 20 天涨幅（ROC）最高的两只股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 7060ec94479d4ec3a00678f02e54513e Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:61
#, python-format
msgid "Allocate 50% of our capital to each stock."
msgstr "将我们的资本的 50% 分配给每只股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:62
#: d25988c437f54da5891f054b53479b30
msgid ""
"If either of the stocks is no longer ranked among the top five 20-day "
"ROCs, then we will liquidate that stock."
msgstr "如果其中一只股票不再位于前五名的 20 天涨幅（ROC）中，则我们将清盘该股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 992f91a10edc4abfaf96ab7f67a092f7 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:63
msgid "Trade these rules daily."
msgstr "每天交易这些规则。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 64c151be01634052be5448e95cd40842 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:65
msgid "Let’s set up our config for the above rules:"
msgstr "让我们为上述规则设置配置："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 31747be8af5549d190293b60e4d5af47 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:86
msgid ""
"To implement the strategy, we write a ``rotate`` function that sets each "
"stock's ```long_score`` "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score>`__"
" to its 20-day ROC. **PyBroker** then ranks the stocks by their "
"``long_score`` in descending order."
msgstr ""
"为了实现该策略，我们编写一个 ``rotate`` 函数，将每只股票的 `long_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score>`__"
" 设置为其 20 天涨幅（ROC）。然后 **PyBroker** 会根据 ``long_score`` 对这些股票进行降序排名。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:108
#: ad680eaad80541e3874a58db0f0d6e90
msgid ""
"Now that we have a method for scoring stocks by their ROC, we can use the"
" `enable_rotation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__"
" method to turn on rotational trading."
msgstr ""
"既然我们已经有了一种根据 ROC 对股票评分的方法，就可以使用 `enable_rotation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__"
" 方法来启用轮动交易。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 011fbe1d6c53466394a470aa0b1add24 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:110
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Setting ``worst_rank_held`` to ``5`` liquidates any currently held stock "
"that falls outside the top five 20-day ROC rankings. Otherwise, "
"**PyBroker** buys up to the top two ranked stocks, allocating 50% of the "
"capital to each. This backtest uses a universe of 10 stocks:"
msgstr ""
"将 ``worst_rank_held`` 设置为 ``5`` 会清盘任何跌出前五名 20 天涨幅（ROC）排名之外的当前持仓股票。否则，"
"**PyBroker** 会买入排名前两位的股票，将 50% 的资金分配给每只股票。这次回测将使用由 10 只股票组成的股票池："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 280cf3066ee9413489baec924c6b0331 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:682
msgid "Custom Position Sizing"
msgstr "自定义仓位配置"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 5aa43b1ee0fb49a692f9c06f57d7ebe0 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:684
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** will allocate our capital equally between positions by "
"default. To customize this, we can pass a ``sizer`` function to "
"`enable_rotation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__."
" The ``sizer`` is called with a `RotationContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.RotationContext>`__"
" after rotation has decided which stocks to buy, allowing us to override "
"the size of each entry. The ``long_ranks`` attribute contains the rank of"
" each stock, where ``1`` is the highest ranked."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，**PyBroker** 会将我们的资金平均分配到各个仓位。若要自定义此行为，我们可以向 `enable_rotation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__"
" 传入一个 ``sizer`` 函数。在轮动决定要买入哪些股票之后，会使用 `RotationContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.RotationContext>`__"
" 调用 ``sizer``，使我们能够覆盖每笔入场的仓位规模。``long_ranks`` 属性包含每只股票的排名，其中 ``1`` "
"表示排名最高。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 455c243e738f4e37bac6375b114761de Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:687
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Let's reuse our strategy, but this time allocate 70% of our capital to "
"the top-ranked stock and 30% to the second:"
msgstr "让我们重用相同的策略，但这次将 70% 的资金分配给排名第一的股票，30% 分配给排名第二的股票："
